        to the RELEASE MANAGER with kind ship_fix (:853-861), because live-reverify
        keys the ticket to the GATE OWNER, and the ship round's owner is the RM.
        A CI re-certification ticket assigned to agentcore_hub_ci_agent is never
        produced by this path.

  ALSO: that assertion requires process.env.LIVE_REVERIFY = 'enforce' (:848), an
  EIGHTH flag that is NOT in item 16's list of seven. LIVE_REVERIFY is pre-existing
  and defaults to off (index.mjs:238, :1336 'if (LIVE_REVERIFY === "off") return'),
  so at shipped defaults the orchestrator files no ship re-verify at all.

